Lemonade Stand V2.5 [08-AUG-1995] StarWare
An IBM/ANSI Game. It's summer vacation and
you have 5 bucks and 30 days before summer
camp starts, YUCK!  Using you 5.00 dollars
and all of your wits,  you open a lemonade
stand. Ok Can you make enough money before
camp in order to payoff the bully that you
know will be waiting at camp to pound you?
